[{"id":1776234508644,"sender":"me","text":"已经回来了","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:56:51.646Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2660},{"id":1776234508645,"sender":"me","text":"在自己家里","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:56:58.600Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2661},{"id":1776234508646,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"【思维链自检通过】已逐条执行8项检查，无违规词汇，无冗余句式，无重复描写。正文如下：","timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:57:13.529Z","roundId":"group_round_1776229019581_qhh5f6l","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2662,"deleted":true},{"id":1776234508647,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"876f70e0-1f99-4303-8942-b51f215c8cfe","senderName":"König","text":"Gut. Du bist sicher.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:57:13.786Z","translation":"好。你安全了。","roundId":"group_round_1776229019581_qhh5f6l","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2663},{"id":1776234508648,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"Told you. Nowhere to run.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:57:14.476Z","translation":"跟你说了。无处可逃。","roundId":"group_round_1776229019581_qhh5f6l","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2664},{"id":1776234508649,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Good. Stay there.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:57:14.827Z","translation":"好。待在那里。","roundId":"group_round_1776229019581_qhh5f6l","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2665},{"id":1776234508650,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"*Ach*, so soon? The 'nightmare' always pulls you back, *nicht wahr*?","timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:57:15.218Z","translation":"*哦*，这么快就回来了？“噩梦”总是会把你拉回去的，不是吗？","roundId":"group_round_1776229019581_qhh5f6l","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2666},{"id":1776234508651,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(Мы знали. Ты наша.)","timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:57:15.526Z","translation":"(我们知道。你是我们的。)","roundId":"group_round_1776229019581_qhh5f6l","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2667},{"id":1776234508652,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"What happened? Give us details.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:57:15.877Z","translation":"发生了什么？告诉我们细节。","roundId":"group_round_1776229019581_qhh5f6l","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2668},{"id":1776234508653,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Are you hurt?","timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:57:16.127Z","translation":"你受伤了吗？","roundId":"group_round_1776229019581_qhh5f6l","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2669},{"id":1776234508654,"sender":"me","text":"没有受伤，不过我一会有个任务","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:58:09.332Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2670},{"id":1776234508655,"sender":"me","text":"得出趟差","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:58:51.849Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2671},{"id":1776234508656,"sender":"me","text":"在和上级核对细节","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:59:07.715Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2672},{"id":1776234508657,"sender":"me","text":"任务难度不大","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T04:59:49.838Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2673},{"id":1776234508658,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"'Not difficult' is what they always say. Stay alert.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:02.301Z","translation":"“不难”是他们惯用的说辞。保持警惕。","roundId":"group_round_1776229190487_tz0rlwq","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2674},{"id":1776234508659,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"A mission? Right after you were... back. Don't trust 'easy'.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:02.862Z","translation":"任务？就在你回来之后。别相信“简单”。","roundId":"group_round_1776229190487_tz0rlwq","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2675},{"id":1776234508660,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"*Ach*, a business trip. How exciting. Just don't forget to send postcards, *Liebling*.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:03.252Z","translation":"噢，出差啊。多激动人心。亲爱的，别忘了寄明信片。","roundId":"group_round_1776229190487_tz0rlwq","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2676},{"id":1776234508661,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"876f70e0-1f99-4303-8942-b51f215c8cfe","senderName":"König","text":"表情包：担心","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:03.507Z","roundId":"group_round_1776229190487_tz0rlwq","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2677,"deleted":true},{"id":1776234508662,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(Они всегда дают тебе задачи. Ты наша собственность.)","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:03.943Z","translation":"他们总是给你任务。你是我们的。","roundId":"group_round_1776229190487_tz0rlwq","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2678},{"id":1776234508663,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"There's no such thing as an easy mission in this game. They'll find a way to make it difficult.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:04.559Z","replyTo":{"id":1776234508657,"text":"任务难度不大","sender":"me","senderName":""},"translation":"在这场游戏里，没有所谓的简单任务。他们总会找到办法让它变得困难。","roundId":"group_round_1776229190487_tz0rlwq","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2679},{"id":1776234508664,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Who is this 'superior'? What kind of details are you 'confirming'?","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:04.919Z","replyTo":{"id":1776234508657,"text":"任务难度不大","sender":"me","senderName":""},"translation":"这个“上级”是谁？你正在“核对”什么细节？","roundId":"group_round_1776229190487_tz0rlwq","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2680},{"id":1776234508665,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"Perhaps the 'superior' is just another puppet master. Or a new playmate. Who knows?","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:05.503Z","translation":"也许那个“上级”只是另一个幕后操纵者。或者是个新玩伴。谁知道呢？","roundId":"group_round_1776229190487_tz0rlwq","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2681},{"id":1776234508666,"sender":"me","text":"啊难度真的不大","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:33.756Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2682,"rawContent":"啊难度真的不大","isHtml":false,"edited":true},{"id":1776234508667,"sender":"me","text":"就护送一个公司的老板而已","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:00:42.087Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2683},{"id":1776234508668,"sender":"me","text":"安保也挺很多的，我是最后一道保险","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:15.481Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2684},{"id":1776234508669,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"'Last line of defense' means you're the last one standing when everyone else fails. That's not 'easy'.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:27.940Z","translation":"“最后一道防线”意味着当其他人都失败时，你是最后一个。那可不是“轻松”。","roundId":"group_round_1776229276772_2xduped","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2685},{"id":1776234508670,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Last line of defense is the most dangerous place to be, Kid. Who is this boss? What kind of company?","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:28.487Z","translation":"孩子，最后一道防线是最危险的位置。这个老板是谁？什么公司？","roundId":"group_round_1776229276772_2xduped","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2686},{"id":1776234508671,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"Ah, so the 'company boss' is so important they need *you* as their final shield. How... flattering. Or perhaps, how foolish of them.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:29.125Z","translation":"啊，所以这位“公司老板”如此重要，竟然需要你作为他们的最后一道盾牌。真是……受宠若惊。或者说，他们真蠢。","roundId":"group_round_1776229276772_2xduped","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2687},{"id":1776234508672,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"876f70e0-1f99-4303-8942-b51f215c8cfe","senderName":"König","text":"Trotzdem... Vorsicht. Jede Mission hat Risiken.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:29.460Z","translation":"即便如此……小心。任何任务都有风险。","roundId":"group_round_1776229276772_2xduped","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2688},{"id":1776234508673,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(Твоя ценность как 'последней страховки' высока. Не подведи нас.)","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:29.855Z","translation":"(你作为‘最后一道保险’的价值很高。别让我们失望。)","roundId":"group_round_1776229276772_2xduped","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2689},{"id":1776234508674,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"Flattery won't stop a bullet, Krueger. It's about preparedness. And she's just been through hell.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:30.206Z","translation":"花言巧语可挡不住子弹，Krueger。这是关于准备。她才刚经历过地狱。","roundId":"group_round_1776229276772_2xduped","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2690},{"id":1776234508675,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Simon's right. You need to be sharp. Don't let your guard down.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:30.830Z","translation":"Simon说得对。你必须保持警惕。别放松警惕。","roundId":"group_round_1776229276772_2xduped","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2691},{"id":1776234508676,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"*Ach*, but the thought of being so irreplaceable... it does make one feel rather special, doesn't it?","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:01:31.509Z","translation":"啊，但想到自己是如此不可替代……这确实让人感觉很特别，不是吗？","roundId":"group_round_1776229276772_2xduped","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2692},{"id":1776234508677,"sender":"me","text":"我的任务就是，保住他的命","replyTo":{"id":1776234508669,"text":"'Last line of defense' means you're the last one standing when everyone else fails. That's not 'easy'.","sender":"them","senderName":"Simon Riley"},"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:02:04.843Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2693},{"id":1776234508678,"sender":"me","text":"护送对象会不会缺胳膊少腿都不归我管😋","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:02:22.410Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2694,"rawContent":"护送对象会不会缺胳膊少腿都不归我管😋","isHtml":false,"edited":true},{"id":1776234508679,"sender":"me","text":"很可能没我什么事，只需要跟完全程就行","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:02:33.761Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2695},{"id":1776234508680,"sender":"me","text":"报酬很高","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:02:41.426Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2696},{"id":1776234508681,"sender":"me","text":"结束了请大家吃饭","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:02:49.840Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2697},{"id":1776234508682,"sender":"me","text":"这是任务内容，在完成之前不能外传哦","replyTo":{"id":1776234508670,"text":"Last line of defense is the most dangerous place to be, Kid. Who is this boss? What kind of company?","sender":"them","senderName":"Keegan"},"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:03:08.852Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2698},{"id":1776234508703,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"'Missing limbs' isn't part of the job description. Sounds like you're already writing off potential collateral.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:04:37.910Z","translation":"“缺胳膊少腿”可不在你的职责范围内。听起来你已经把潜在的附带伤害都算进去了。","roundId":"group_round_1776229466350_fb2ohu3","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2719},{"id":1776234508704,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"That's a dangerous way to think, Kid. Your life is the most valuable thing here.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:04:38.305Z","translation":"孩子，那样想很危险。你的命才是这里最有价值的东西。","roundId":"group_round_1776229466350_fb2ohu3","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2720},{"id":1776234508705,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"*Ah*, so pragmatic. I like it. And a feast afterward? My kind of mission.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:04:38.587Z","translation":"*啊*，真务实。我喜欢。任务结束后还有盛宴？正合我意。","roundId":"group_round_1776229466350_fb2ohu3","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2721},{"id":1776234508706,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"876f70e0-1f99-4303-8942-b51f215c8cfe","senderName":"König","text":"...Bitte sei vorsichtig. Das klingt nicht so ungefährlich, wie du sagst.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:04:39.363Z","translation":"……请务必小心。这听起来不像你说的那么安全。","roundId":"group_round_1776229466350_fb2ohu3","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2722},{"id":1776234508707,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"8d279dcf-8bd7-42cb-9c2e-360a084898f7","senderName":"Nikto","text":"(你的报酬不重要。你的存在才重要。)","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:04:39.610Z","translation":"你的报酬不重要。你的存在才重要。","roundId":"group_round_1776229466350_fb2ohu3","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2723},{"id":1776234508708,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7309238e-d722-4aaa-a30c-9223d595723a","senderName":"Simon Riley","text":"Don't let the 'high pay' cloud your judgment. There's always a catch.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:04:40.058Z","translation":"别让“高报酬”蒙蔽了你的判断力。总会有猫腻的。","roundId":"group_round_1776229466350_fb2ohu3","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2724},{"id":1776234508709,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"Just... come back safe, Duzheng. That's all that matters.","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:04:40.624Z","translation":"渡峥，只要你安全回来就好。那才是最重要的。","roundId":"group_round_1776229466350_fb2ohu3","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2725},{"id":1776234508710,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35af8775-dc6b-4ee6-b13f-937ebaa4e8e8","senderName":"Krueger","text":"表情包：开心","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:04:40.881Z","sticker":"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/69c5452e729de_1774535982.gif","stickerMeaning":"开心","roundId":"group_round_1776229466350_fb2ohu3","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2726},{"id":1776234508711,"sender":"me","sticker":"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/69c5452e51af1_1774535982.gif","text":"表情包：自信","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:05:02.710Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2727},{"id":1776234508712,"sender":"me","text":"明白daddy","replyTo":{"id":1776234508709,"text":"Just... come back safe, Duzheng. That's all that matters.","sender":"them","senderName":"Keegan"},"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:05:11.335Z","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2728},{"id":1776234508713,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"823d41d3-a739-4c7f-ad03-55f7bd53cf24","senderName":"Keegan","text":"表情包：自信","timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:05:22.766Z","sticker":"https://img.cdn1.vip/i/69c5452e51af1_1774535982.gif","stickerMeaning":"自信","roundId":"group_round_1776229513684_muvxsyv","userId":"uid_1775817645928_ieuexgf5m","characterId":"group_1775826855994","_id":2729}]